Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep under the Sahara lies one of the largest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,stores of fresh water on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This ancient water fell as rain more than ten
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,thousand years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Today farmers pump it up to grow wheat in circles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,of green
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But once it is gone it will not come back for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.78,0:00:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,thousands of years
